  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3a26717e-38dc-50b5-ad4a-fe225ca2fc68" activityNameId="6bf07aea-e53d-555c-a536-04378472380f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Toner module, laser jet, colour, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Toner module, laser jet, colour, at plant
This dataset refers to a standard colour toner cartridge (cyan, yellow, magenta or black, CMYK) with a capacity of 5'000 prints A4 and a coverage of 5%, specifically a HP C4096A for HP2100 printers. Original equipment manufacturer (OEM) manufacturing assumed, no remanufacturing.  An update was made in 2023 to the manufacturing energy consumption. Weight: 880g plus 260g toner contained; Geography: European Electricity mix and material processing data for supplier outside Europe.; UUID: 242fdbc5-9668-38d5-baf6-8ac6eee244b3
Includes the manufacturing of the semifinished parts, toner powder, the material transport to the site, the assembly, the packaging, No direct emissions are considered.
Location: European Electricity mix and material processing data for supplier outside Europe.
Technology: Assembly of the semifinished components by OEM to cartridges.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_242fdbc5-9668-38d5-baf6-8ac6eee244b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
